{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101203","id":2262860435,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6G4IKT","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101203","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101203.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101203.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101203","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101203/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101203/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101203/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/838fde11e3909a5b57d24d59221041616cdaf558","number":101203,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[DRAFT] Add functions and a signal for analyzing the undo/redo history of a TextEdit and fix docs","user":{"login":"wareya","id":585488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NTQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/585488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya","html_url":"https://github.com/wareya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wareya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"My attempt at addressing https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11502 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3178; also fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101167 because it was right next to the docs I had to add.\r\n\r\nThe undo/redo system in TextEdit is ***incredibly*** fragile, and single key inputs each have their own linked list entries (?????) even after the actions are fully committed, so the relevant code was really hard to understand and I'm not sure I got it right. So this is a draft and the new functions and signal need testing. This is also why I had to address https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3178; without those functions, it was impossible to test that the new signal (and `get_prev_version()`) worked properly.\r\n\r\nHere's a project for testing this out (ignore the name, I repurposed a previous bug report test project): \r\n[wrapbugrepro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18326100/wrapbugrepro.zip)\r\n\r\nNew functions:\r\n```\r\nget_undo_count() -> int\r\n- Returns the number of available \"undo\" actions in the undo/redo history.\r\n\r\nget_redo_count() -> int\r\n- Returns the number of available \"redo\" actions in the undo/redo history.\r\n\r\nget_prev_version() -> int\r\n- Returns the version number of the undo/redo state that will be applied if an undo is performed.\r\n```\r\n\r\nNew signals:\r\n\r\n```\r\noperation_done(line_start : int, line_end : int)\r\n- Emitted when the text changes and a new undo operation has been created for the change\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"